# The "pluck bass" preset on the bass track: a line with accents, then the lowest notes (octave -3: the string runs
# at a half and a quarter of the sample rate below ~46 Hz). Short steps: note-off damps each note (release 30).
tempo 120
steps 16
tail 1.0
track bass
preset 50 120 0 0 255 30 0 0 128 0 128 210 0 0 0 0 0 0
note 0 E1 2 110
note 2 E1 1 60
note 4 G1 2 127
note 6 A1 1 80
note 8 E2 2 100
note 10 F0 2 127
note 12 C1 2 100
note 14 E0 2 127
expect sound 0 16
expect idle 22
expect peak_below -6      # one voice peaks near -12 dBFS; a releasing note overlaps the next
